  "containers": {
    "passiveCard": "<div id=\"card-sec-1\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-1\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">Basic effect(s)</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-1\"><li>ATK &amp; DEF 250%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Receives an additional Ki +1 per AGL Ki Sphere obtained</li><li>Chance of performing a critical hit &amp; damage reduction rate 40%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>\"Saiyan Saga\" or \"Giant Ape Power\" Category allies' ATK &amp; DEF 40%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-2\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-2\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">1 or more AGL Ki Spheres obtained and 1 or more Rainbow Ki Spheres\nobtained</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-2\"><li>\"Saiyan Saga\" or \"Giant Ape Power\" Category allies' ATK &amp; DEF 20%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> and attacks are effective against all Types</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-3\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-3\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When attacking</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-3\"><li>ATK &amp; DEF 150%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Damage reduction rate 20%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>ATK &amp; DEF 100%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">, launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack and attacks guaranteed to hit when facing only 1 enemy</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-4\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-4\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">After performing 2 or more attacks in battle</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-4\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Chance of performing a critical hit 20%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-5\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-5\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">After performing 6 or more attacks in battle</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-5\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Chance of performing a critical hit 20%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-6\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-6\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every attack performed</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-6\"><li>ATK 150%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> and damage reduction rate 7%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> within the turn</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-7\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-7\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When facing 2 or more enemies, or starting from the 3rd turn from\nthe character's entry turn</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-7\"><li>Meets up with Nappa and can perform Reversible Exchange</li></ul></div>",
